Description: A comprehensive R package that extends the functionality of 
    the janitor package with advanced features for currency conversion, 
    automated data cleaning, and interactive health visualization. 
    Built upon the foundation of janitor by Sam Firke 
    (https://github.com/sfirke/janitor), this package provides real-time 
    currency conversion across 146 world currencies with API support, 
    automated data cleaning pipeline for missing values and outlier removal, 
    interactive health dashboard for data quality assessment, professional 
    visualization tools including heatmaps and sunburst charts, statistical 
    inference reports with Chi-square test and effect size analysis, and 
    cross-validation for categorical data distributions. Designed for data 
    scientists, analysts, and researchers who need an all-in-one toolkit 
    for data preparation and exploratory analysis.
